  "explanation": "<p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed my-2\">Ta có $1\\ \\text{kWh} = 1000\\ \\text{W} \\cdot 3600\\ \\text{s} = 3{,}6\\cdot 10^{6}\\ \\text{J}$.</p><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed my-2\">$\\Rightarrow 2\\ \\text{kWh} = 2 \\cdot 3{,}6\\cdot 10^{6}\\ \\text{J}$</p><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed my-2\">$\\Rightarrow 2\\ \\text{kWh} = 7{,}2\\cdot 10^{6}\\ \\text{J}$.</p><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed my-2\">Kết luận: 2 kWh $= 7{,}2\\cdot 10^{6}$ J (chọn phương án có giá trị này).</p>",
